<title>USA: Bearings names Robinson vice chairman.</title>
<headline>Bearings names Robinson vice chairman.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bearings Inc said Thursday that president and chief operating officer John Robinson has been named to the newly-created position of vice chairman of the corporation.</p>
<p>The company said John Dannemiller, chairman and chief executive officer, will assume the additional title of president.</p>
<p>Robinson was elected president and COO in 1992 and has been with the company for over 30 years.</p>
</text>
